<title>FRANCE: Pathe drops on BSkyB slide.</title>
<headline>Pathe drops on BSkyB slide.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in French media group Pathe fell sharply on Monday after a slide on Friday in shares of television company British Sky Broadcasting Group Plc.</p>
<p>At 0809 GMT, Pathe was down 6.28 percent at 1,135 francs. Pathe has 17 percent stake in BSkyB which issued a profit warning on Friday with its first half results.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
